#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""agent-data — the job-khoja engine: a free, keyless, unlimited local CLI.

Speaks a stable set of CLI verbs and JSON envelopes, so the plugin's wrapper
scripts (search-jobs.sh / fetch-posting.sh) and record-api-response.sh work
unchanged. No API keys, no billing, no monthly cap.

Sources (all free public endpoints):
  ashby      https://api.ashbyhq.com/posting-api/job-board/{org}
  greenhouse  https://boards-api.greenhouse.io/v1/boards/{org}/jobs
  lever      https://api.lever.co/v0/postings/{org}?mode=json
  remotive   https://remotive.com/api/remote-jobs
  remoteok   https://remoteok.com/api
  weworkremotely  https://weworkremotely.com/categories/remote-programming-jobs.rss

Company boards come from sources.json in this directory (structure below).
```
{
  "ashby": ["org-a", "org-b"],
  "greenhouse": ["org-c"],
  "lever": ["org-d"]
}
```
"""

